==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[láta#Icelandic|láta]]'' (meaning "to [[let]]") + ''[[vita#Icelandic|vita]]'' (meaning "to [[know]]"). Literally meaning "to [[let]] [[know]]".

